    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54658" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταντλ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pour</i> water or liquid <i>down</i> one's throat,
				<i><span class="en">
				Alex.
				85
			</span></i>; <i>pour over</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς τὰ λοιπὰ
				μέρη τοῦ σώματος κατήντλουσαν</span>
				(3pl.
			impf.) <i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				3.168
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>: metaph., <i>pour a flood of words
			over</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῦτά τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>V.</u>
					483
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. λόγον κατὰ τῶν ὤτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					344d
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φιλοσοφίας γέλωτα κ</span>. ib.
				<i><span class="en">
				536b
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ποιήματα ημῶν κ</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ly.</u>
				204d
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ούμενος ταῖς τῶν βασάνων τρικυμίαις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>4 Ma.</u>
					7.2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>bathe</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. τι ἐλαίῳ</span>”
